  "name": "VisualPRM400K-v1.1",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tVisualPRM400K-v1.1\n\t\n\n[\ud83d\udcc2 GitHub]\n[\ud83d\udcdc Paper]\n[\ud83c\udd95 Blog]\n[\ud83e\udd17 model]\n[\ud83e\udd17 dataset]\n[\ud83e\udd17 benchmark]\nNOTE: VisualPRM400K-v1.1 is a new version of VisualPRM400K, which is used to train VisualPRM-8B-v1.1. Compared to the original version, v1.1 includes additional data sources and prompts during rollout sampling to enhance data diversity.\nNOTE: To unzip the archive of images, please first run cat images.zip_* > images.zip and then run unzip images.zip.\nVisualPRM400K is a dataset comprising\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenGVLab/VisualPRM400K-v1.1.",
